==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Celesse (Enemy)|Celesses]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Nono (Enemy)|Nonos]] spawn, delay 3~13.33 seconds<sup>90f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Serum (Enemy)|Serums]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Fuu (Enemy)|Fuu]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Aura (Enemy)|Aura]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Olga (Enemy)|Olgas]] spawn, delay 3.33~16.67 seconds<sup>100f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Olga (Enemy)|Olgas]] spawn, delay 1.33~3.33 seconds<sup>40f~100f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Norn (Enemy)|Norns]] spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

